  "document": "The Parson and the Outlaw\nThe Parson and the Outlaw is a 1957 American western directed by Oliver Drake for Charles' Buddy' Rogers Productions and distributed by Columbia Pictures. Written by Drake and John Mantley, the film stars Anthony Dexter as Billy the Kid, along with Buddy Rogers, Sonny Tufts, Marie Windsor and Jean Parker. This was the final screen appearance for Rogers before his retirement from films."
